  "checkerNothingFoundNote": "That does not mean they are safe together. Labels leave interactions out, and often name medicines only by a group, such as “NSAIDs” or “combined hormonal contraceptives”, which this check cannot match.",
  "@checkerNothingFoundNote": {"description": "Shown wherever the labels connect a pair in none of the ways the check looks for. It must never read as a reassurance; interaction_copy_test bans the words that would make it one."},
